<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">常见问题</h2>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">养发皂适合什么发质？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">适合各种发质，尤其推荐油性头皮、头屑反复、头皮瘙痒及掉发困扰人群使用。敏感头皮同样适用。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">多久能看到效果？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">一般连续使用2-4周可见头皮出油减少、头屑改善。长期使用（1-3个月）效果更稳定。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">每天都可以用吗？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">油性头皮可隔天使用，中性或干性头皮建议每周2-3次。根据自身头皮状态调整频率即可。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">孕妇可以用吗？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">本产品0硅油、0月桂醇、0防腐剂、0硫酸盐、0人工香精，配方温和。建议使用前咨询客服获取详细成分信息。</div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">如何保存养发皂？<span class="faq-toggle"><i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></span></div>
        <div class="faq-answer">请置于干燥通风处保存，使用后放在沥水皂托上，避免长时间泡水可延长使用寿命。</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.faq { padding: 80px 0; background: #fff; }
.faq-list { max-width: 760px; margin: 40px auto 0; }
.faq-item {
  border: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
  border-radius: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: box-shadow 0.3s;
}
.faq-item:hover { box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }
.faq-question {
  padding: 18px 24px;
  font-size: 16px;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: #2d4a2a;
  cursor: pointer;
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  user-select: none;
}
.faq-question:hover { background: #f8f9f0; }
.faq-toggle { transition: transform 0.3s; color: #4a7c3f; }
.faq-item.active .faq-toggle { transform: rotate(180deg); }
.faq-answer {
  padding: 0 24px;
  max-height: 0;
  overflow: hidden;
  transition: max-height 0.3s ease, padding 0.3s ease;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #666;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.faq-item.active .faq-answer {
  max-height: 200px;
  padding: 0 24px 18px;
}
</style>

<script>
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {
  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(function(q) {
    q.addEventListener('click', function() {
      this.parentElement.classList.toggle('active');
    });
  });
});
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ" }]
}
{% endschema %}